  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General Objective: The general objective of the operation is to support the productive development of the State of Paran (PR) by fostering sustainable private investment.Specific Objective: The specific objective is to support productive private investment in Paran through the strengthening of the management and governance of the Paran Strategic Fund (FEPR), with an emphasis on exporting SMEs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Objetivo General: El objetivo general de la operacin es apoyar el desarrollo productivo del Estado de Paran (PR) mediante el fomento de la inversin privada de manera sostenible. Objetivo Especfico: El objetivo especfico es apoyar la inversin privada productiva en Paran a travs del fortalecimiento de la gestin y la gobernanza del Fondo Estratgico de Paran (FEPR), con nfasis en las PYMEs exportadoras.</narrative>
  </description>
